---

<section id="top" class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-8 pb-14 pt-12 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:gap-10 sm:pt-24">
    <div class="min-w-0">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">Hyojeong Yun</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-500">M.S. Student · Graduate School of Artificial Intelligence (GSAI) · POSTECH</p>
        <div class="md mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-neutral-700">
            <p>
                I am a master's student in the Data Systems Lab at POSTECH, advised by Prof. Wook-Shin Han.
                My research focuses on <strong>how vector embeddings behave in retrieval, and on designing
                retrieval systems around that behavior</strong>.
                Embeddings bring text, images, and video into a shared space and underpin everything from
                vector search to RAG, yet their behavior during retrieval remains underexplored.
            </p>
            <p>
                I explore this across the retrieval stack, from cross-modal approximate nearest neighbor
                search in the systems layer to multimodal RAG in the application layer
                (<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.00923" {...newTab}>CANOPY</a>).
                My goal is to build retrieval systems that account for both the strengths and the limits
                of embeddings.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm">
            {links.map((link) => (
                <li>
                    <a href={link.url} {...(link.url.startsWith('http') ? newTab : {})} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-600 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900">
                        <svg viewBox={link.viewBox ?? '0 0 16 16'} class="h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d={link.icon} /></svg>
                        <span class="link-line">{link.label}</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            ))}
        </ul>
    </div>
    <Image
        src={profile}
        alt="Hyojeong Yun"
        width={256}
        loading="eager"
        class="h-24 w-24 shrink-0 rounded-2xl object-cover ring-1 ring-neutral-200 sm:mt-1 sm:h-32 sm:w-32"
    />
</section>
